SUMMARY:📣 Auto-post: #3 Blog guide · How long does it take to build a
  website in Singapore? ⏱️
DESCRIPTION:Posts automatically to Facebook + Instagram (Mon–Fri only\,
  skipped on SG public holidays).\n\nCaption:\nHow long does it take to b
 uild a website in Singapore? ⏱️\n\nA standard business site takes 1
 –2 weeks once your content is ready. Larger or custom builds with more
  pages\, features or integrations take 6–8 weeks.\n\nThe biggest facto
 r is rarely design or coding. It's how quickly content and decisions mov
 e. To stay on schedule:\n✅ Have your text\, photos and logo ready on d
 ay one\n✅ Nominate one person to approve feedback\n✅ Save "can we al
 so add…" ideas for phase 2\n\nFull guide\, including what to prepare 
 👇\nhttps://www.adssentialmarketing.com/how-long-to-build-a-website-si
 ngapore/\n\n#WebDesignSingapore #SmallBusinessSG #WebsiteTips
