SUMMARY:📣 Auto-post: #6 Blog guide · Does your website need an llms.t
 xt file? 🤔
DESCRIPTION:Posts automatically to Facebook + Instagram (Mon–Fri only\,
  skipped on SG public holidays).\n\nCaption:\nDoes your website need an 
 llms.txt file? 🤔\n\nllms.txt is a 2024 proposal\, not an official sta
 ndard. Google ignores it\, and no major AI company says it relies on one
 \, so treat it as optional.\n\nWhat matters more for AI search today: yo
 ur robots.txt settings\, and clear pages that answer customers' question
 s directly.\n\nFull breakdown before you pay anyone to set one up 👇\n
 https://www.adssentialmarketing.com/what-is-llms-txt/\n\n#GEO #AISearch 
 #SEOSingapore
